## 11. Production QA Revision Round (mobile / WeChat / Samsung)

**Root cause of most mobile issues:** the stylesheet had no `text-size-adjust`, so WeChat / Samsung / Android in-app browsers auto-inflated text — overflowing the funding badge (Samsung, image 1) and overlapping the Roadmap title with its status badge (WeChat, images 3–4). Fixed globally.

| # | Item | Status | What changed |
|---|------|--------|--------------|
| 1 | Responsive / no horizontal scroll / overflow | ✅ Fixed | Added `text-size-adjust:100%`, `overflow-x:hidden` (html+body), global `overflow-wrap:break-word`. Verified **0px horizontal overflow** at 360/390/768/1440. |
| 2 | WeChat built-in browser | ✅ Root-caused | Same `text-size-adjust` fix (the standard remedy for WeChat/Android font-boosting) + removed WebGL (see #4) which is the main source of in-app-browser jank/CLS. |
| 3 | Technical Roadmap cards equal + no overlap | ✅ Fixed | Badges fixed uniform width (88px desktop / 108px mobile). On mobile the title/badge now **stack vertically** — badge can no longer overlap the title. Verified overlap=false at all widths. |
| 4 | Hero blue effect (remove particles) | ✅ Replaced | Removed the entire three.js particle/voxel shader; replaced with a **smooth CSS neon-blue radial glow** (two layered gradients, gentle pulse, honors reduced-motion). No particles/noise. Also removed 1.3 MB `three` dependency + vendor file → lighter, faster, and far better in-app-browser compatibility. |
| 5 | Aladdin Strategic Partner | ⏸ **BLOCKED — needs your OK** | You previously said "do NOT publish until contract signed + Peter's wording approved." Not added. Confirm it's signed/approved and I'll add it. |
| 6 | Investor Deck button | ⏸ **Needs target** | Happy to re-add left of "Request Full Deck", aligned/uniform — but it needs somewhere to point (public deck PDF upload / email / disabled) or it 404s again. |
| 7 | Two paragraphs wrapping/margins | ✅ Fixed | `text-size-adjust` + `overflow-wrap` fixes the mid-word email break and the oversized WeChat text; monospace paragraphs now wrap normally and align across breakpoints. |
| 8 | Delete demo-video placeholder | ✅ Removed | Removed the `// VIDEO PLACEHOLDER … demo-video.mp4` block and its now-dead CSS. |
| 9 | Bottom circle decoration | ❓ **Need you to mark it** | Could not find a matching element in code. Please circle it in a screenshot (like image 1) so I remove the right thing. |
| 10 | Font brightness / contrast | ✅ Improved | Brightened the too-dim "SCALE" title and PLANNED/FUTURE badges (were failing WCAG AA and near-invisible on mobile). Consistent weight retained; glow not increased (kept readable). |
| 11 | WeChat display (images 3–7) | ✅ Addressed | Covered by #1–#4, #7. |
| 12 | Samsung Galaxy (image 1) | ✅ Fixed | Funding badge now wraps (auto-height, centered) instead of clipping; verified not clipped at 360px. |

**Verified (headless Chromium, 360 / 390 / 768 / 1440):** 0px horizontal overflow; no roadmap overlap; funding badge not clipped; particles gone; CSS glow present; production build passes.

